  "goodToKnow": "Die Symmetrie is symmetry: die Symmetrie eines Gesichts, einer Fassade, Achsensymmetrie (axial symmetry) in maths. Baroque palaces like Würzburg's Residenz are built on strict symmetry. Symmetrisch means symmetrical; asymmetrisch and die Asymmetrie are the opposites, also used for unequal power: asymmetrische Kriegsführung. Stress on the last syllable. Plural: die Symmetrien."
